<title>USA: Wall Street Deli sets shr buyback.</title>
<headline>Wall Street Deli sets shr buyback.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS, Tenn. 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wall Street Deli Inc said on Monday that its board of directors has approved a stock buyback of up to 250,000 shares.</p>
<p>Earlier, the company announced first quarter 1997 earnings of $0.07 per share compared to $0.01 a year ago.</p>
</text>
